OL,4,CSelf-driving shuttles aid fans while   
OL,5,Clift is fixed                          
OL,6,GA trial of self-driving shuttle buses  
OL,7,Ghas been expanded to transport         
OL,8,Gfootball supporters with disabilities  
OL,9,Gand mobility issues while a lift is    
OL,10,Gbroken at a stadium.                   
OL,12,FThe service takes MK Dons fans from a  
OL,13,Fcar park pick-up and drop-off area to  
OL,14,Ftheir entry point at Stadium MK in     
OL,15,FMilton Keynes.                         
OL,17,FFans who usually enter via Gate Seven, 
OL,18,Fwhere the broken lift is, are now      
OL,19,Fusing other entrances. Wheelchair user 
OL,20,FAntony Yates said the shuttle meant he 
OL,21,Fcould avoid having to navigate the     
OL,22,F"big hill" leading to Gate One.   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
