OL,4,CCabbie takes ill children on Christmas 
OL,5,Clights tour                            
OL,6,GA taxi driver helped bring Christmas   
OL,7,Gcheer to dozens of seriously ill       
OL,8,Gchildren by taking them on a free tour 
OL,9,Gof London's festive lights.            
OL,11,FPaul Evans was among 28 black cab      
OL,12,Fdrivers who took youngsters being      
OL,13,Ftreated at Great Ormond Street         
OL,14,FHospital (GOSH) and their families on  
OL,15,Fa special trip around the capital on   
OL,16,FWednesday.                             
OL,18,FThe taxis, decorated with fairy lights 
OL,19,Fand tinsel, passed landmarks including 
OL,20,FRegent Street and the London Eye.      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
